        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0691" n="583" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg583"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bonsal to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-06-05"><hi rendition="#italic">June 5, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received June 17.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to inclose a copy in English of Mr.
                    Snowden’s note to the minister of state, in regard to his interview of May 27,
                    under date of May 31, and also the reply in Spanish and English from the
                    minister of state, under date of June 2.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stephen Bonsal.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d564-a1.xml" xpointer="d564-a1"/>
